        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Count scheduled services with 班",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "班 counts scheduled transport services. A train service and a physical train are not the same counting perspective.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这班火车去北京。",
                "pinyin": "zhè bān huǒchē qù Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "This train service goes to Beijing.",
                "audio": "a08bfd113cfa5f3bdbcd7ee49d1d4be258e5e58201c33627d426a89231079d1d"
              },
              {
                "text": "今天有三班火车。",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān yǒu sān bān huǒchē 。",
                "meaning": "There are three train services today.",
                "audio": "f02969b5ed15a83b7dd2c3b463d24db3e6e79ebc358b3bbbe0e611f5b0ef52ed"
